    {
      "id": "claim_e69214aa99d646a9b18c66ebd68cc86d",
      "statement": "RaindropApiClientImpl is a separate Spring bean from RaindropService specifically so the @CircuitBreaker(name=\"raindrop\")/@Retry(name=\"raindrop\") annotations on listCollections/createBookmark take effect through Spring AOP proxying, avoiding the self-invocation bypass that would occur if the annotated methods lived on RaindropService itself.",
