      "statement": "application.yaml lists org.bartram.myfeeder.integration.RaindropNotConfiguredException under ignore-exceptions for both the resilience4j circuitbreaker instance \"raindrop\" and the retry instance \"raindrop\", so an unconfigured token does not open the circuit breaker or consume retry attempts.",
